      "id": "github:663663407",
      "name": "HydroServer",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "开源、可自托管的环境监测时序数据平台，面向水文与环境监测站点，提供观测数据的采集、存储、管理、共享，以及站点/数据流元数据、ETL编排和访问控制。",
      "homepage": "https://hydroserver.org",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/hydroserver2/hydroserver",
      "github_repository_id": 663663407,
      "license": "BSD-3-Clause",
